%% # Scene 09 — spur, single carrier, happy path
%% # Prepare -> Sample Acquisition -> Sample Complete -> Release, on a spur.
%% # Carrier flow: right to left on the Main-Lane; the spur rises perpendicular to it.
%% # Coordinates are in a fixed 1920x1080 space (track panel: x 30..950, y 120..885).
%% # Points left of x=30 or right of x=950 are outside the panel (hidden).
%% geometry spur
%% subtitle Spur — single carrier with sample tube, happy path
sequenceDiagram
    participant IF as Interface
    participant AN as Analyzer
    participant DMX as DMX

    %% carrier C1 SID-000123 route=main_in,nsd,pit_in,spur_in,queue2,queue,sampling,spur_top_in,spur_top_out,spur_out,pit_out,merge,iface_out,main_out,gone

    %% caption 1 · Spur | The spur is a U-shaped branch perpendicular to the Main-Lane: the carrier goes up one branch, past the sampling point (analyzer on its right), and comes back down the other.
    %% at 2.2
    %% move C1 to sampling
    %% on antenna1 C1
    %% caption 2 · Diverted — Prepare — Sample Acquisition | The carrier is diverted without stopping into a short piece of pit-lane that turns into the spur: Prepare. The gate stops it on the sampling point of the up branch: Sample Acquisition.
    %% on antenna1 C1
    %% highlight nsd duration=2
    %% on antenna1
    IF->>AN: Prepare SampleId=SID-000123
    %% after 0.1
    AN-->>IF: OK SampleId=SID-000123
    %% on antenna2
    IF->>AN: Sample Acquisition SampleId=SID-000123
    %% after 0.1 OK C1
    AN->>DMX: Query SampleId=SID-000123
    %% after 0.1 Sample Acquisition C1
    %% for C1
    AN-->>IF: OK
    %% after 0.1 Query C1
    DMX-->>AN: Tests to perform SampleId=SID-000123
    %% after 0.1 OK C1
    %% caption 3 · Test query — Pipetting | After the reply to Prepare the analyzer has asked DMX (LIS) which tests to perform. Now it aspirates the tube, while the gate holds the carrier at the sampling point.
    %% after 0.1 OK C1
    %% pipette sp duration=4.5
    %% after 0.2
    %% caption 4 · Sample Complete | When aspiration is finished the analyzer sends Sample Complete. Only then does the interface release the carrier, which goes round the top of the spur and down the other branch.
    %% after 0.3 pipette sp
    AN->>IF: Sample Complete SampleId=SID-000123
    %% after 0.1
    %% for C1
    IF-->>AN: OK
    %% move C1 to gone
    %% on antenna3 C1
    %% caption 5 · Release | As soon as the carrier has left the interface module, the interface sends Release: the sample has left the analyzer interface.
    %% on antenna3
    IF->>AN: Release SampleId=SID-000123
    %% after 0.1
    %% for C1
    AN-->>IF: OK
    %% after 0.5
    %% caption 6 · Results | Later, when the analysis is complete, the analyzer sends the results to DMX.
    %% after 0.5 OK C1
    AN->>DMX: Results SampleId=SID-000123
